GIMP Palette
Name: Tales from Space
Columns: 8
# Station palette measured from the tgstation icons survey
# (1,471-sheet census, 2026-08-30). Ramps hold hue constant;
# saturation rises as value drops; darkest step doubles as the
# outline. Avoid pure #000000 on solids. Signal colours are the
# only full-saturation paint and take no outline.
